[2.3352, "o", "\r\u001b[K› /help\r\n › /help                      every command, and your skills\r\n   /goal <objective>          keep going until it's done and verified\r\n   /loop <[5m] [x10] prompt>  repeat on an interval, or let rusty pick the pace\r\n   /compact [focus]           summarise now; say what matters most to keep it in detail\r\n   /side new <name> | open <id or name> | list open a persistent read-only side discussion\r\n   /send main                 send selected side findings to the main chat\r\n   /back                      return to the main chat\r\n   /btw [question]            ask from existing context without changing the main chat\r\n   36 more · ↑↓ choose · tab completes · enter runs\u001b[9A\r\u001b[3C"]
